","parts":[{"text":"அடு","lemma":"aṭu","gloss":"approach"},{"text":"த்து","lemma":"ttu","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having approached"},{"surface":"எறி","parts":[{"text":"எறி","lemma":"eṟi","gloss":"strike"}],"gloss":"striking"},{"surface":"குறட்டின்","parts":[{"text":"குறட்டின்","lemma":"குறட்டின்","gloss":"on the anvil"}],"gloss":"on the anvil","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நின்று","parts":[{"text":"நின்று","lemma":"niṉṟu","gloss":"having stood"}],"gloss":"having stood"},{"surface":"மாய்ந்தனனே","parts":[{"text":"மாய்ந்தனன்","lemma":"māyntaṉaṉ","gloss":"he died"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"he died indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறப்புகழ்","parts":[{"text":"மறப்புகழ்","lemma":"மறப்புகழ்","gloss":"valorous fame"}],"gloss":"valorous fame","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நிறைந்த","parts":[{"text":"நிறை","lemma":"niṟai","gloss":"fill"},{"text":"ந்த","lemma":"nta","gloss":"adjectival participle suffix"}],"gloss":"filled"},{"surface":"மைந்தினோன்","parts":[{"text":"மைந்து","lemma":"maiṉtu","gloss":"strength"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"oblique suffix"},{"text":"ஓன்","lemma":"ōṉ","gloss":"he who has"}],"gloss":"strong man"},{"surface":"இவனும்","parts":[{"text":"இவன்","lemma":"ivaṉ","gloss":"this man"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"this man too"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உறைப்புழி","parts":[{"text":"உறைப்பு","lemma":"uṟaippu","gloss":"leakage"},{"text":"உழி","lemma":"uḻi","gloss":"place"}],"gloss":"place of leakage"},{"surface":"ஓலை","parts":[{"text":"ஓலை","lemma":"ōlai","gloss":"palm leaf"}],"gloss":"palm leaf"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"pōla","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறைக்குவன்","parts":[{"text":"மறைக்குவன்","lemma":"மறைக்குவன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெரும","parts":[{"text":"பெரும","lemma":"பெரும","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நிற்","parts":[{"text":"நிற்","lemma":"நிற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குறித்துவரு","parts":[{"text":"குறித்துவரு","lemma":"குறித்துவரு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வேலே","parts":[{"text":"வேலே","lemma":"வேலே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"To this man, having given, please drink the toddy! O angry-warring / herded-male-elephant, elephant, and moving-chariot lord! / To your father's father, this man's father's father, / in the battle of lifting and throwing, without blinking, like a carpenter / standing on the struck anvil, died. / Filled with valorous fame, this strong man too, / like a palm leaf at the place of leakage, / will shield, O Great Lord, the spear that comes aiming at you!","translation":"Give some to him first, and then drink the toddy, O Lord of herded male elephants and swift-moving chariots! To your grandfather, this man's grandfather was like a carpenter who, without blinking in the battle of lifting and striking, stood by his anvil and died. This strong man, filled with valorous fame, will also shield you, O Great Lord, like a palm leaf covering a leak, from the spears that come aiming at you!","modern":"சினந்து போரிடும் யானைக் கூட்டங்களையும் இயங்கும் தேர்களையும் உடைய தலைவனே! இவனுக்குக் கள்ளைக் கொடுத்துவிட்டு நீயும் குடித்திடுவாயாக! உன்னுடைய பாட்டனாருக்கு இவனுடைய பாட்டனார், போர்க்களத்தில் கண் இமைக்காமல் நின்று, பட்டறைக் குறட்டின் மேல் நின்று வேலை செய்யும் தச்சனைப் போலப் போரிட்டு மாய்ந்தார். வீரமும் புகழும் நிறைந்த வலிமை மிக்க இவனும், கூரையில் நீர் கசியும் இடத்தில் வைக்கப்படும் ஓலையைப் போல, உன்னை நோக்கிக் குறிவைத்து வரும் வேல்களைத் தன் மார்பால் தடுத்து உன்னைக் காப்பான், பெருமானே!","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Puram genre, specifically the karantai tiṇai, which celebrates the recovery of cattle and the valor of warriors. The poet Avvaiyar addresses a chieftain, urging him to honor a young warrior by offering him toddy first before drinking it himself. She reminds the king of the young warrior's lineage: his grandfather served the king's grandfather with absolute devotion, dying in battle like a steadfast carpenter working at his anvil without blinking. Now, this young warrior, inheriting that same strength and loyalty, will stand before the king and shield him from incoming spears, just as a palm leaf patches a leak in a roof. The key words are 'taccaṉ' (carpenter), 'kuṟaṭu' (anvil), 'ōlai' (palm leaf), and 'maṟaikkuvaṉ' (he will shield).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.29],[1.29,1.6],[1.6,2.2],[2.2,2.2],[2.2,4.2],[4.2,4.4],[4.4,5.5],[5.5,5.7],[5.7,6.7],[6.7,7.1],[7.1,8.59],[8.59,8.59],[8.59,9.4],[9.4,9.8],[9.8,10.86],[10.86,10.86],[10.86,11.49],[11.49,12.1],[12.1,12.12],[12.2,13.6],[13.6,14.0],[14.0,14.62],[14.62,14.78],[14.93,15.43],[15.43,15.43],[15.43,15.5],[15.5,17.1],[17.1,17.1],[17.1,17.1],[17.1,18.4],[18.4,18.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.4,1.6],[1.7,2.3],[2.65,3.5],[3.5,4.4],[4.4,4.6],[4.6,5.8],[5.8,6.0],[6.0,7.1],[7.1,7.4],[7.4,8.8],[8.8,9.5],[9.5,9.9],[9.9,10.3],[10.3,11.4],[11.5,12.1],[12.16,12.4],[12.66,12.91],[12.91,13.17],[13.3,14.5],[14.5,14.9],[14.9,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[16.13,16.3],[16.3,17.0],[17.0,17.4],[17.4,17.63],[17.63,18.09],[18.09,18.09],[18.09,19.47],[19.7,20.0]]},"sync":[[["இவற்கு","to this man"],["ஈந்து","having given"]],[["உண்மதி","please drink"]],[["கள்ளே","toddy indeed"]],[["சினப்போர்","angry war"]],[["இனக்களிற்று",""]],[["யானைஇயல்தேர்க்",""]],[["குருசில்",""]],[["நுந்தை","your father"]],[["தந்தைக்கு","to the father"]],[["இவன்தந்தை","this man's father"]],[["தந்தை","father"]],[["எடுத்து","having lifted"],["எறி","striking"]],[["ஞாட்பின்","in the battle"]],[["இமையான்","without blinking"]],[["தச்சன்","carpenter"]],[["அடுத்து","having approached"],["எறி","striking"]],[["குறட்டின்","on the anvil"]],[["நின்று","having stood"]],[["மாய்ந்தனனே","he died indeed"]],[["மாய்ந்தனனே","he died indeed"]],[["மறப்புகழ்","valorous fame"]],[["நிறைந்த","filled"]],[["மைந்தினோன்","strong man"]],[["இவனும்","this man too"]],[["உறைப்புழி","place of leakage"]],[["ஓலை","palm leaf"]],[["போல","like"]],[["மறைக்குவன்",""]],[["பெரும",""]],[["நிற்",""]],[["குறித்துவரு",""]],[["வேலே",""]]]}